  "releaseNotes": "v0.2.0.0\n\t\t\t- Released alongside NHSOneLondon.AuditAndMetrics.Clients 0.2.0.0, as the two packages always ship at the same version.\n\t\t\t- Breaking: adds ISecurityAudit and its storage exceptions (AlreadyExistsSecurityAuditException, LockedSecurityAuditException, FailedStorageSecurityAuditException), and eight security audit members on IAuditAndMetricStorageBroker that every host must implement.\n\t\t\t- Breaking: BulkInsertAuditsAsync and BulkInsertMetricsAsync take IEnumerable<T> rather than List<T>.\n\t\t\t- Breaking: IMetric inherits IKey, as IAudit does.\n\t\t\t- Upgrade guide: https://github.com/NHSISL/NHSOneLondon.AuditAndMetrics#upgrading-from-01x",
